1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:03,350
Shizuoka Region - Japan U-15 Team Training Camp

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:08,610
Japan U-15 European Tournament

3
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,730
Today's match against Toho

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,610
concluded the training camp.

5
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,860
I am now announcing the list of selected members

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:14,110
who will go to the European tournament.

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:25,420
The lucky ones must prove they deserve our trust.

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:28,000
Likewise, those who were not selected

9
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,880
you did not waste your time.

10
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,050
During this training period

11
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:36,680
try to make good use of everything you have learned.

12
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,010
- Understood? - Yes, coach!

13
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:44,520
You have my support. Good luck.

14
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,560
Forwards: Captain Kojiro Hyuga, Kazuki Sorimachi, Tappei Kizugi, Mitsuru Sano, Hajime Taki, Shun Nitta

15
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:18,240
Midfielders: Hikaru Matsuyama, Masao Tachibana, Kazuo Tachibana, Takeshi Sawada, Mamoru Izawa

16
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:20,380
Defenders: Shingo Takasugi, Ryo Ishizaki, Hiroshi Jito, Makoto Soda

17
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,700
Goalkeepers: Ken Wakashimazu, Yuzo Morizaki

18
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:45,850
Thank you.

19
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:48,650
You must win at all costs.

20
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,650
We are with you from the bottom of our hearts.

21
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:52,690
Guys...

22
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,030
Guys...

23
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:57,320
Us too! We'll play in your place as well.

24
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,160
We really trust you!

25
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,870
What's wrong, Tsubasa-kun?

26
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,330
Nothing.

27
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:09,040
Football is sometimes cruel.

28
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:13,260
This camp brought together Japan's best players.

29
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,430
Now only 17 remain, but only 11

30
00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:19,100
will take the field.

31
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:21,430
Tsubasa-kun.

32
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,680
Mikami-san!

33
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:26,440
I don't want to make you worry, but

34
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:29,900
I have a message for you from Katagiri.

35
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,690
A message for me?

36
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:35,070
The France Youth Tournament

37
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:37,820
starts in two weeks.

38
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:42,490
Katagiri wants you in full health for these matches.

39
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:57,260
JUNIOR YOUTH

40
00:03:17,420 --> 00:03:21,720
Port of Hamburg - Germany

41
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:26,720
Episode 2 - Greetings to an Old Enemy

42
00:03:31,690 --> 00:03:32,520
Father.

43
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:35,270
Hello, Karl Heinz.

44
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:37,650
You look well.

45
00:03:39,650 --> 00:03:42,320
So you're going to Munich.

46
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:43,910
Yes.

47
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,830
With your mother and Marie?

48
00:03:46,990 --> 00:03:47,870
No.

49
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:52,710
My mother works. She's staying here with Marie.

50
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:56,840
Are you still wearing it around your neck?

51
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:01,010
It helps me play better football.

52
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:04,340
You gave it to me for my 7th birthday.

53
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:09,930
It was always with you when you played in the Bundesliga.

54
00:04:11,390 --> 00:04:13,690
That was a long time ago...

55
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:20,030
Besides, your mother gave it to me.

56
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:22,190
I don't want to see it anymore.

57
00:04:23,860 --> 00:04:24,950
Father...

58
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:33,710
We finally arrived in Germany!

59
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:37,750
First, we'll visit Hamburg's training facility.

60
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:48,100
All these football pitches are here?

61
00:04:48,430 --> 00:04:49,680
Incredible!

62
00:04:49,810 --> 00:04:53,480
Wakabayashi-san developed for three years in these dream conditions!

63
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,310
That's right, kids.

64
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,600
Wakabayashi-san!

65
00:04:57,810 --> 00:04:59,440
I knew I'd see you here!

66
00:04:59,610 --> 00:05:01,480
You all look great!

67
00:05:01,690 --> 00:05:02,690
Genzo.

68
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:06,200
Mikami-san, it's good to see you again.

69
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,320
How you've grown, Genzo.

70
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:12,370
News of your achievements has even reached Japan.

71
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:14,960
It's been a long time, Wakabayashi-san.

72
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:15,870
Yes.

73
00:05:16,330 --> 00:05:17,500
I'm happy.

74
00:05:17,670 --> 00:05:20,750
The Shutetsu guys were also selected for Japan.

75
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Yes!

76
00:05:22,250 --> 00:05:23,420
Wakabayashi.

77
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:27,050
Beating Ozora Tsubasa isn't my only goal.

78
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:29,350
I have a second goal.

79
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,350
That is to score a goal against you.

80
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:35,520
With a shot from outside the penalty area!

81
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,390
Hyuga...

82
00:05:38,850 --> 00:05:41,900
Frankly, without Tsubasa, Japan

83
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:45,150
has no chance of beating us.

84
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,650
What did you say!?

85
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:53,290
Anyway, good luck tomorrow.

86
00:05:56,910 --> 00:05:58,040
Hyuga!

87
00:05:58,210 --> 00:05:59,460
Wakabayashi.

88
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:02,920
Tomorrow we'll see

89
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:05,960
how much you've improved in Germany.

90
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:10,550
Nankatsu City - Shizuoka

91
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:13,180
Shall we start with some passing?

92
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:14,180
Yes!

93
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:16,310
Are you sure you're alright, Tsubasa-kun?

94
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,060
Yes.

95
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:20,190
The doctor was surprised at how quickly I recovered.

96
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:21,770
Hey, Tsubasa!

97
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,110
Hello.

98
00:06:23,230 --> 00:06:25,940
Urabe-kun and the rest of the Otomo team!

99
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,320
Can we join you?

100
00:06:28,490 --> 00:06:31,490
What's up? Got bored over the summer?

101
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,200
Sort of.

102
00:06:33,370 --> 00:06:37,580
Let's play together. The more people, the more fun football is!

103
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:38,580
Yes!

104
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:41,630
I thought you'd rest a bit after the national cup.

105
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:44,500
But Tsubasa-kun's passion for football

106
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:50,720
has only grown stronger.

107
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,020
Mom.

108
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,730
I went to see my father.

109
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,560
Brother!

110
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,650
Tomorrow at 3 p.m.

111
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:08,940
I'll play my last match for Hamburg.

112
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:12,740
Will you come and watch with Marie?

113
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,990
I want to come! Will you let me, Mom?

114
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:16,870
Karl.

115
00:07:17,290 --> 00:07:19,200
Why did you see your father?

116
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:22,330
I asked him to come watch the match.

117
00:07:24,330 --> 00:07:27,090
Mom, won't you talk to him?

118
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:29,920
Do it for me and Marie.

119
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:36,930
I'm sorry, but I have work tomorrow.

120
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,970
Mom!

121
00:07:41,980 --> 00:07:44,020
- Alright! - Get ready!

122
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:47,480
Let's go and catch Tsubasa!

123
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,740
- Too fast! - Cut him off!

124
00:08:01,250 --> 00:08:04,500
He got through! He passed the 4 Knights of Otomo!

125
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:08,710
Catch, here it comes!

126
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:10,800
Tsubasa, don't!

127
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,380
You haven't fully recovered yet!

128
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:13,760
It's fine!

129
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:17,140
I can't wait two weeks

130
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:21,430
for the World Cup!

131
00:08:21,890 --> 00:08:23,350
I want to shoot!

132
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:33,200
I must fight alongside the others on the world stage!

133
00:08:33,650 --> 00:08:35,200
Drive Shot!

134
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,160
Yes! The Drive Shot is back!

135
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,450
Nothing less expected from Tsubasa.

136
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:42,700
Tsubasa is amazing!

137
00:08:42,830 --> 00:08:45,670
Yes, being a three-time champion is no accident.

138
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:47,170
I'm ready.

139
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:51,510
With this number 10 jersey, I'm ready to take Europe by storm!

140
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:58,470
What a big crowd today.

141
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,810
It's normal, because Emperor Schneider

142
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:03,350
is playing his last game for Hamburg.

143
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:05,270
In this friendly match,

144
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:09,270
you will feel the power of a European club team.

145
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:13,360
This is a serious challenge testing our Japan team's strength.

146
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:15,450
Give it your all.

147
00:09:15,570 --> 00:09:16,490
Yes, coach!

148
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:19,320
Our goal is victory.

149
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,410
In all the matches to come.

150
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:24,000
We will return to Japan undefeated.

151
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:28,790
Considering the France Tournament, this is an important match.

152
00:09:29,130 --> 00:09:33,090
Our first opponent in three years, Genzo Wakabayashi!

153
00:09:34,260 --> 00:09:36,800
The match will start soon.

154
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:39,510
And Schneider still hasn't arrived.

155
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:44,520
Schneider's dog!

156
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:46,730
- He's here! - It's him!

157
00:09:46,850 --> 00:09:48,310
- Finally! - He arrived...

158
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:53,230
Hamburg and Germany's young emperor...

159
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:55,190
Schneider!

160
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:58,570
Coach, sorry I'm late.

161
00:09:58,950 --> 00:10:01,240
Alright, how are you?

162
00:10:01,370 --> 00:10:02,780
Everything's fine.

163
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:09,420
Stay here and watch me, Sousou.

164
00:10:09,710 --> 00:10:12,670
There he is. Karl Heinz Schneider.

165
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:16,170
The defense must mark him tightly today.

166
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,300
Yes, coach!

167
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:21,850
Right now, he's probably the only German player

168
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,810
who can beat Genzo.

169
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:30,900
Germany's number one striker, Karl Heinz Schneider.

170
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:38,110
Today, Tatsuo Mikami, coach of the Japan U-15 Team,

171
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,320
starts the European tournament.

172
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:44,580
Facing Germany's top team, Hamburg.

173
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:49,080
And in Hamburg, a Japanese youth who has lived in Germany for three years,

174
00:10:49,210 --> 00:10:53,590
Genzo Wakabayashi, guards the goal.

175
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:01,010
Hey, are you looking for someone?

176
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,180
No.

177
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:07,970
JAPAN - HAMBURG

178
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:10,980
Let's show them the football power of Japan!

179
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:12,150
Okay!

180
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,980
They won't get past us!

181
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:17,230
Guys! Play according to our strategy!

182
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,610
Okay!

183
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,740
Finally, the match is starting!

184
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:25,870
Get ready, Takeshi!

185
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:27,450
Right, Hyuga-san!

186
00:11:34,710 --> 00:11:37,050
Karl Heinz Schneider.

187
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,630
I came to see your performance.

188
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,970
Team: Hamburg

189
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,970
Date of Birth: July 4th

190
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,970
Height: ...

191
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,970
Weight: ...

192
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,970
Blood Type: ...

193
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,310
That Japanese number 9 is strong!

194
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,980
He's really powerful!

195
00:11:55,730 --> 00:11:59,860
Japan's captain Hyuga-kun, dribbling straight forward,

196
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:03,320
tossing opponents aside.

197
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:07,660
Takeshi!

198
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:08,490
Alright!

199
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:09,830
Here it is!

200
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:13,920
This combination passing between Hyuga-kun and Sawada-kun, Toho's golden duo!

201
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:18,300
Well done, Hyuga, Sawada!

202
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,420
Why isn't he moving?

203
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:27,930
So in the end, my parents didn't come.

204
00:12:28,470 --> 00:12:33,270
Hyuga-kun, with Sawada-kun's help, escapes the marking and advances on goal!

205
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,810
Now he's in a shooting position!

206
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:38,860
Your turn, Wakabayashi.

207
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:43,320
Catch, Wakabayashi!

208
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:47,320
No ball from outside the penalty area can get past him!

209
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:49,160
Get ready, Wakabayashi!

210
00:12:49,490 --> 00:12:50,950
As a greeting,

211
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:54,290
I'll show you how much I've improved in these three years!

212
00:12:54,410 --> 00:12:56,710
Tiger Shot!

213
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:59,670
A shot from outside the penalty area!

214
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:01,800
Nice, it's definitely a goal, Captain!

215
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,470
Even against Wakabayashi!

216
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,930
Wakabayashi isn't moving at all!

217
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,270
The ball exploded!

218
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:16,520
The ball hit the post, no goal!

219
00:13:16,770 --> 00:13:20,440
Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun didn't move an inch!

220
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:22,860
Couldn't you react?

221
00:13:23,070 --> 00:13:27,410
Or did you know the ball would hit the post, Genzo?

222
00:13:29,070 --> 00:13:31,030
You've improved, Hyuga.

223
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,290
That was a friendly welcome.

224
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:38,000
Next time, I'll rattle your goal, Wakabayashi.

225
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:44,300
Wake up from your daydream in the middle of the match.

226
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:47,130
You shouldn't take us lightly!

227
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,680
Play resumes.

228
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:55,060
Wakabayashi-kun sends the ball forward.

229
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:57,230
This is mine!

230
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,650
Nita-kun swiftly snatches the ball!

231
00:14:00,190 --> 00:14:01,900
In its first match in Europe,

232
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:04,900
Japan is attacking fearlessly.

233
00:14:08,410 --> 00:14:09,160
Nita!

234
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,410
I'm scoring now!

235
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:13,910
Come on!

236
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:18,330
Nita-kun unleashes the Falcon Scissors nonstop!

237
00:14:19,370 --> 00:14:20,630
H-he caught it!

238
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:23,170
Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun caught the ball!

239
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:25,170
Great, Wakabayashi!

240
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:31,050
Hamburg is in trouble! What kind of counterattack will they show us?

241
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:33,050
Next up, it's my turn!

242
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:38,140
This time Soda-kun receives the ball on the left wing!

243
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:40,770
He's breaking through!

244
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:43,690
And now he takes a long-distance shot!

245
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:46,190
Did he put spin on his shot?

246
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,190
The ball changed direction in the air!

247
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:51,240
But Wakabayashi-kun controls the ball.

248
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:54,030
So did he predict the ball's direction?

249
00:14:54,410 --> 00:14:55,580
That's impossible!

250
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:59,330
He saw my sharp spinning shot for the first time and read its direction!

251
00:15:00,830 --> 00:15:03,840
Their left side is open. Attack!

252
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:06,170
Wakabayashi-kun sends a long pass.

253
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,840
Is the ball going to Hamburg?

254
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,340
I won't allow it!

255
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:12,840
Matsuyama-kun blocked him!

256
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:15,310
My turn, Wakabayashi!

257
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:18,350
Here it is!

258
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:21,650
Matsuyama-kun, the child of Hokkaido, the land of snow,

259
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:23,860
attempts a long-range Eagle Shot!

260
00:15:24,770 --> 00:15:27,610
Oh! The ground shot was also saved!

261
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:29,030
Damn it!

262
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:34,910
As always, you guard your goal perfectly, Genzo.

263
00:15:35,330 --> 00:15:36,490
But

264
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:40,910
Hamburg's other players seem sluggish today.

265
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:45,460
Especially the striker Schneider, what happened to him?

266
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:50,130
We'll score the first goal!

267
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:51,880
Of course, brother!

268
00:15:52,050 --> 00:15:53,590
We believe in you, Nita!

269
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,390
Alright!

270
00:15:56,390 --> 00:15:58,140
Nita-kun is crossing!

271
00:16:00,390 --> 00:16:01,810
Go, Kazuo!

272
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:02,690
And here it comes!

273
00:16:02,810 --> 00:16:06,940
This is the aerial acrobatics football of the Tachibana twins, Masao-kun and Kazuo-kun!

274
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:08,900
Take this, Wakabayashi!

275
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:11,820
The space storm rained down from the sky...

276
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:13,740
but he still saved it!

277
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:15,820
What incredible reflexes!

278
00:16:15,990 --> 00:16:18,700
- You're amazing! - You're too good, Wakabayashi!

279
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:21,580
Wakabayashi has no flaws!

280
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:23,710
He is an SGGK!

281
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:27,460
In other words, Super Great Goalkeeper Genzo Wakabayashi-kun!

282
00:16:29,090 --> 00:16:31,090
- Well done! - You're awesome!

283
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:34,970
Genzo Wakabayashi.

284
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:37,800
He is a professional goalkeeper.

285
00:16:38,390 --> 00:16:40,850
Pascal? You came too?

286
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:44,850
And that Japanese number 9's shot is something else...

287
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:46,190
Ah, yes...

288
00:16:46,350 --> 00:16:49,940
But ultimately, technique is what matters in football.

289
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,820
You're right.

290
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:55,320
They are definitely no match for Argentina.

291
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:01,370
Japan takes the ball again!

292
00:17:01,490 --> 00:17:02,950
Here it is!

293
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:05,750
Wakabayashi is the only one we need to fear!

294
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:09,880
Defending in this match is a walk in the park for us.

295
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:13,920
Is the level of the Germans really this low?

296
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,010
What are you doing, Hamburg!

297
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:20,140
We didn't come all this way to watch your weak play!

298
00:17:21,010 --> 00:17:25,640
At the start of the match, you let Japan attack freely

299
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:28,310
and take shots?

300
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,480
What are you implying, Wakabayashi?

301
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:32,980
I want to see with my own eyes

302
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:35,700
how much my teammates

303
00:17:35,950 --> 00:17:38,360
have progressed over these three years.

304
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:40,950
Are you sure you want to take such a risk?

305
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:43,500
What if they end up scoring?

306
00:17:43,830 --> 00:17:47,040
Don't worry, that won't happen.

307
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:49,460
Pull yourself together, Hamburg!

308
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,130
This is incomprehensible!

309
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:53,380
The fans are booing us.

310
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:58,180
Wakabayashi, we can't go on like this.

311
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:01,640
- Sawada! - Right!

312
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:03,010
Come on, Takeshi!

313
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:04,640
Hyuga-san!

314
00:18:04,890 --> 00:18:06,270
- Never! - What?

315
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,230
Hamburg has started moving!

316
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:11,270
Hermann Kaltz intercepted the pass!

317
00:18:11,610 --> 00:18:13,270
Well done, Kaltz!

318
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,780
This is the Hamburg I know!

319
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:17,280
Damn it! I'll take it back now!

320
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:20,570
Nita-kun, who runs 50 meters in 6 seconds,

321
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:22,370
is chasing him!

322
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:26,870
He's dribbling past!

323
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:29,250
Move forward, guys!

324
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:30,250
Okay!

325
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,960
Hermann Kaltz.

326
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:34,960
Known as the workhorse of Hamburg.

327
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:39,510
The real game starts now!

328
00:18:39,970 --> 00:18:42,390
The joke is over, guys!

329
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:43,560
Come on, Japanese!

330
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:46,270
We'll show you our real power now!

331
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:49,100
Hamburg has transformed!

332
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:53,480
They're going towards Japan's goal with rapid, chain-like passes!

333
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:57,110
Good! That's real Hamburg football!

334
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,400
They're not the same team as before.

335
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:01,110
What suddenly happened?

336
00:19:01,410 --> 00:19:02,990
Listen to me carefully!

337
00:19:03,620 --> 00:19:05,660
I warned you.

338
00:19:05,870 --> 00:19:09,870
Without Tsubasa, you have no chance of beating us!

339
00:19:10,250 --> 00:19:13,080
Until now, we let you attack

340
00:19:13,210 --> 00:19:15,250
to test your strength.

341
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:17,260
What? Are you joking?

342
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:20,220
Was that just to test us?

343
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:23,640
Don't mock us, Wakabayashi!

344
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:24,760
Hyuga-san!

345
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:28,980
Hyuga-kun unleashes his anger!

346
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:30,140
Great!

347
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:33,520
No one can handle the fighting spirit

348
00:19:33,650 --> 00:19:35,730
of Kojiro Hyuga-kun!

349
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:38,070
You mocked me, Wakabayashi!

350
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:41,780
This time, my Tiger Shot will tear your net!

351
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,780
Bring it on, Hyuga!

352
00:19:48,370 --> 00:19:49,750
Schneider?

353
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:57,250
What happened!?

354
00:19:57,380 --> 00:20:00,130
Hyuga-kun was thrown into the air!

355
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:01,800
- Hyuga! - Hyuga-san!

356
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:04,800
What happened? Everything happened in an instant!

357
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:09,810
But one thing is clear. This is Emperor Karl Heinz Schneider's playing style!

358
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,560
And now Schneider-kun starts dribbling!

359
00:20:14,690 --> 00:20:16,060
He won't get past!

360
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,070
What a captivating feint!

361
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:21,110
Quick! He...

362
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,450
...dribbled past us just like Tsubasa!

363
00:20:23,610 --> 00:20:24,950
We'll cut him off, Sawada!

364
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:25,700
Right!

365
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:28,410
This time, he goes through with power.

366
00:20:28,530 --> 00:20:29,540
What!?

367
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:31,700
He did Hyuga's direct dribbling!

368
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:34,710
Schneider-kun is advancing at maximum speed!

369
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:38,590
It's impossible to stop him. He dribbles as fast as Tsubasa!

370
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:42,590
- Come on, let's block him! - He can't jump over us!

371
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:45,680
Still, he must get past Japan's two defenders,

372
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:47,600
Takasugi-kun and Jito-kun!

373
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,600
Kaltz-kun!

374
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,390
With a backheel pass to Kaltz-kun!

375
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:51,350
Schneider!

376
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:58,110
A powerful acrobatic overhead kick!

377
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:01,440
Goooooooooool!

378
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:04,450
Hamburg opens the scoring!

379
00:21:04,570 --> 00:21:07,820
Japan's goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun didn't react!

380
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:12,000
Schneider-kun made this extraordinary strike from a difficult position!

381
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:15,290
Hamburg takes the lead in the 15th minute!

382
00:21:15,460 --> 00:21:17,210
We were dominating...

383
00:21:17,330 --> 00:21:20,500
- In the blink of an eye... - They scored on us!

384
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,630
So this is really...

385
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:25,300
...the true level of Europe!?

386
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:27,800
Wakabayashi.

387
00:21:28,430 --> 00:21:30,760
This is my last match for Hamburg.

388
00:21:31,350 --> 00:21:33,180
I intend to set the pitch on fire.

389
00:21:33,980 --> 00:21:38,440
Before saying goodbye, I want to use my full power against you.

390
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:41,520
Alone, I want to beat your national team, Japan!

391
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:46,450
Mom and Dad, you still haven't come.

392
00:21:46,650 --> 00:21:50,330
But the whole city of Hamburg is watching me.

393
00:21:50,910 --> 00:21:52,370
And soon,

394
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:55,290
all of Germany, and then the whole world

395
00:21:55,540 --> 00:21:57,580
will watch my game!

396
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:05,840
You came, Tsubasa?

397
00:22:05,970 --> 00:22:06,800
Yes!

398
00:23:44,610 --> 00:23:49,940
To be continued...

399
00:23:44,610 --> 00:23:49,940
Professional Players